{"v":4,"catch":"新英雄的曙光！跨越千年的故事現在開始展開！","desc":"一千年前，發生了一場與金龍和銀龍之間的大戰，而雙龍在這場戰鬥中皆被封印。許多世紀後，銀龍再度甦醒，並對一個邊境村莊發起攻擊。\n\n擔任守衛的皇家騎士盧卡斯不知道自己其實是曾經將金龍和銀龍封印成人形的英雄之後裔。不過，當悲劇來襲時，他隨即踏上了拯救世界的冒險之旅！","publisher":"KEMCO","release":"2020-11-05","genres":["角色扮演","冒險","策略","格鬥"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7ec494eeee3a6050f7cceabde2c4df54f03261092819c98cea6c9874cf782325.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a3dadbfd13a0886d0363eae69b6aae554a01e87f86a674e20358497a2a86a256.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0aba7de8452d1658cc29a9994be19e71e7514fa31182bbdba87a7b82adf8d764.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4e413db62011622c2ed3651448ad5c08dbdefc5d5587bd414a245180a9970f25.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/55b37d8205bd5f003920d7e6ffca98f65b9956496c589a6636dffb0d6ed272ab.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/889cb7a4a0964c1b068b60d6dff4c4e83c70a58549345158cafb516f42b0368d.jpg"],"titleId":"010076f012cd8000","dlc":[],"vids":["1T_HJbjNz0U"]}